//! Falcon — native (Slint + wgpu) frontend, Phase 2 (PLAN §20.5, §21.3).
//! Builds on Phase 1 (smooth scrub, full-res-on-stop via nvJPEG, pan/zoom) with a
//! reusable design system (the `Theme` global + `GlassPanel`/`IconBtn`/`Chip`/
//! `ToggleRow`/`FilmThumb` components) and the UI replicated from the old React
//! build: custom title bar (Settings `*` + Scrub-speed buttons + centred path +
//! window controls), a Settings popup (dev HUD / nvJPEG / wheel-nav toggles +
//! benchmark), a Scrub-speed popup (5/12/30 presets + custom + benchmark note),
//! an EXIF info panel, and a windowed filmstrip (thumbnail + R+J + frame number,
//! scrolls with the current shot).
//!
//! Scale: the fast-tier decode is now a WINDOWED prefetch pump (a worker pool fed
//! a ±window around the current shot, single-flight + chase-latest) with a
//! distance-LRU fast cache — so folders of thousands of shots stay bounded in
//! memory while scrub stays smooth.
#![cfg_attr(not(debug_assertions), windows_subsystem = "windows")]

#[cfg(test)]
